<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 175-9 V MASHONALAND - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 175-9 V MASHONALAND - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 175 for nine when bad</p>
<p>light forced an early closure on the opening day of their</p>
<p>four-day match against Mashonaland at Harare Sports Club on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
</text>
